' View of proposed AppSec Agent Harness; see study for scope and correspondence.
@startuml appsec-investigation-sequence
!include ../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/interaction/sequence-diagram-style.iuml

title AppSec investigation - V4 authorized evidence read
autonumber
actor Analyst
participant Orchestrator
participant "Model provider" as Model
participant "Execution broker" as Broker
participant "Policy decision service" as PDP
database "Evidence store" as Evidence
database "Run store" as Run
Analyst -> Orchestrator : Request scoped investigation
Orchestrator -> Model : Approved context and schema
Model --> Orchestrator : Proposed read
Orchestrator -> Orchestrator : Validate schema
Orchestrator -> Broker : Canonical typed intent
Broker -> PDP : Trusted principal, scope and intent
PDP --> Broker : Decision and version
alt explicit allow and current scope
 Broker -> Evidence : Read redacted metadata
 Evidence --> Broker : Revision-bound evidence
 Broker -> Run : Record decision and result digest
 Broker --> Orchestrator : Sanitized result
 Orchestrator --> Analyst : Evidence-linked recommendation
else deny, undefined or timeout
 Broker -> Run : Record denial
 Broker --> Orchestrator : Denied; no tool execution
 Orchestrator --> Analyst : Escalate or abstain
end
@enduml
